OL,3,AThree men sentenced to death in Jordan
OL,4,Aover fatal church mass shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jordanian court has sentenced three
OL,7,Fmen to death by hanging for carrying
OL,8,Fout a fatal mass shooting on a church
OL,9,Flast month.
OL,11,FThe attack on 23 October killed nine
OL,12,Fpeople and injured 34 others who had
OL,13,Fbeen attending a Christian funeral at a
OL,14,FGreek Orthodox church in Karak
OL,15,Fgovernorate.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
